@startuml
title Startup, Monitor and Recovery Lifecycle
start
:Start onedrive;
:Load configuration;
:Open / validate item database;
:Inspect/reconcile physical sync_dir;
:Detect and safely recover stale FUSE state;
:Establish direct access to physical backing tree;
:Establish/validate local monitoring for resident content;
:Mount FUSE over configured sync_dir;
:FUSE presents authoritative DB namespace;
:Run normal sync / --monitor processing;

fork
  :Remote Graph/delta monitoring;
  :Update entire eligible DB namespace;
fork again
  :Local monitoring;
  :Observe hydrated physical content only;
end fork

stop
@enduml
